-
-The sinusoidal positional encoding is defined as [S2]:
-$$
-\gamma(x) = [\sin(x), \cos(x), \dots, \sin(2^{m-1}x), \cos(2^{m-1}x)]^T
-$$
-where $m$ is the number of sinusoids.
